 "name": "Web Notification Working Group",
 "is_closed": true,
 "description": "The mission of the Web Notification Working Group, part of the Rich Web Client Activity, is to produce specifications that define APIs to generate notifications to alert users. A Notification in this context may be displayed asynchronously and may not require user confirmation. Additionally, events are specified for managing user interactions with notifications.",
